# Derived by hand from Type System ch. 3 (`^Eq`, `^Ord`, `^Num`; `-?` and `/` give `?` on the integers, comparison of records, tuples and arrays is structural, in order) and Semantics ch. 4 (`<|` merges, the hold steps in the tick of the click); the run agrees byte for byte.
